wn, I'll have to buy another before we find ourselves in this type of mess again. When does this lunch shift start?\n<br><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Noon. If Jim doesn't arrive with the fridge by 8:30, I'll have a word with him."}, {"time": "40000", "image": "engenn11le01ob07re2img01.jpg", "id": 2, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Bill</span>: How's everything else going aside from the fridge issue? It looks like the numbers are down in the last quarter. I hope I'm doing some troubleshooting here not damage control.\n<br><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: It's a bit of both right now. I am really working on customer relations right now. The staff is improving.  I told them if they won't  be professional, they're done. If they won't heed my advice, they will be sorry!\n<br><span class=\"strong\">Bill</span>: I caught wind of a story about a waitress undressing in the restaurant. If she hasn't been reprimanded, I'll have to insist you do that.\n<br><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>:  Of course I spoke to her! She only took her socks off, but that was disturbing. God Bill, I've never heard you sound so definitive! But, yes, I said, \u201cIf you won't conduct yourself in a professional manner, you'll have to go.\u201d I am giving her a week, maybe two, to see if she can meet expectations."}, {"time": "97000", "image": "engenn11le01ob07re2img02.jpg", "id": 3, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Bill</span>:  I'm glad you're on top of it Vanessa!  I see you've changed the menu. It looks good. If there are other areas that need improving, now's the time to tell me. When I come back from the Maldives in the next couple of months, I'll check in again.\n<br><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Well, when I get feedback, the customers say we need a fresh coat of paint ...\n<br><span class=\"strong\">Bill</span>:  Sure, but what about you? Do you need anything from me? ... like a raise? Let's say 10%?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: I could hug you!"}]}}], "title": "", "type": "audio", "template_override": 1}]}]}